@startuml
title RuleSphere - Activity Diagram\n01. Administration | UC-01..04
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF5FF
skinparam activityBorderColor #496477
|Administrator / Authorized Owner|
start
:Choose administrative operation;
:Provide target scope and data;
|Control Plane|
:Authenticate and check action permissions\nwithin Tenant / Workspace;
if (Authorized scope?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return access error;
  stop
endif
switch (Operation)
case (Tenant / Workspace)
  :Validate ownership and configuration;
case (Membership / Roles)
  :Validate scoped membership and role assignment;
case (API Credential)
  :Validate issuance or revocation request\nand permitted credential scope;
case (Shared Library)
  :Validate reusable asset and Tenant ownership;
endswitch
if (Request valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return validation errors without applying change;
  stop
endif
switch (Operation)
case (Tenant / Workspace)
  :Store Tenant / Workspace configuration;
case (Membership / Roles)
  :Update scoped role assignments;
case (API Credential)
  :Issue scoped credential or revoke credential;
case (Shared Library)
  :Publish exact immutable Shared Library version;
endswitch
:Record immutable attributable audit evidence;
:Return operation result;
|Administrator / Authorized Owner|
:View configuration / credential / library result;
stop
note right
Cross-workspace reuse requires an exact Tenant Shared Library version.
No direct cross-workspace or cross-tenant references.
end note
@enduml
